<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{{title}} · Arc Admin</title>
    {{> layout}}
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="shell">
      {{> shell-sidebar}}
      <main class="main">
        <div class="page-head">
          <h1>Badges</h1>
          <p class="sub">{{count}} definition{{#unless countSingular}}s{{/unless}}</p>
        </div>
        {{#if flashOk}}<p class="flash flash-ok">{{flashOk}}</p>{{/if}}
        {{#if flashErr}}<p class="flash flash-err">{{flashErr}}</p>{{/if}}

        <h2 class="section-title">How to add a badge</h2>
        <div class="panel" style="margin-bottom:18px">
          <p style="margin-top:0">
            Badge unlocks when user progress hits the criteria. Fill the form below →
            set <strong>status = active</strong> → reuse a <strong>known counter/event key</strong>
            (unknown keys never unlock without a code change).
          </p>

          <ol style="margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:1.25rem;line-height:1.55">
            <li><strong>Code</strong> — unique slug, e.g. <code>ten-lessons</code> (lowercase, <code>-</code>/<code>_</code> ok).</li>
            <li><strong>Name / description</strong> — shown in the app catalog.</li>
            <li><strong>Criteria type</strong> — pick one, then match JSON shape (examples below).</li>
            <li><strong>Reward JSON</strong> — optional, e.g. <code>{"coins":25}</code> or <code>{"gems":5}</code>.</li>
            <li><strong>Image</strong> — optional here; after create, open the badge → upload PNG/WebP.</li>
            <li>Save → unlocks automatically next time matching domain event runs.</li>
          </ol>

          <p class="muted" style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:0.8rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em;font-weight:600">Worked example — complete 10 lessons</p>
          <div class="form-grid" style="gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px">
            <div>
              <label>Code</label>
              <input type="text" value="ten-lessons" readonly />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label>Name</label>
              <input type="text" value="Ten Lessons" readonly />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label>Criteria type</label>
              <input type="text" value="counter" readonly />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label>Status</label>
              <input type="text" value="active" readonly />
            </div>
            <div style="grid-column:1/-1">
              <label>Criteria JSON</label>
              <textarea rows="2" readonly>{"counterKey":"lessons_completed","target":10}</textarea>
            </div>
            <div style="grid-column:1/-1">
              <label>Reward JSON</label>
              <textarea rows="1" readonly>{"coins":40}</textarea>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p class="muted" style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:0.8rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em;font-weight:600">Criteria cheat sheet</p>
          <div class="table-wrap">
            <table class="data">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th>Type</th>
                  <th>Criteria JSON</th>
                  <th>Live keys</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <td class="mono">counter</td>
                  <td class="mono">{"counterKey":"lessons_completed","target":5}</td>
                  <td>lessons_completed, weeks_completed, quizzes_passed, perfect_quizzes, practices_completed, deep_lessons, challenges_passed, battle_wins, study_sessions_qualified</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="mono">distinct_set</td>
                  <td class="mono">{"setKey":"lesson_formats","setTarget":5}</td>
                  <td>lesson_formats, study_partners</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="mono">consecutive</td>
                  <td class="mono">{"consecutiveKey":"weekly_streak","minConsecutive":2}</td>
                  <td>weekly_streak</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="mono">event_once</td>
                  <td class="mono">{"eventType":"roadmap.generated.v1"}</td>
                  <td>roadmap.generated.v1, weekly_plan.activated.v1, comeback.completed.v1</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="mono">referral_milestone</td>
                  <td class="mono">{"referralQualified":5}</td>
                  <td>referrals_qualified</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="mono">composite</td>
                  <td colspan="2"><span class="muted">Deferred — will not unlock yet.</span></td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          <p class="muted" style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:0.85rem">
            Tip: leave status <code>draft</code> while testing fields, then switch to <code>active</code> when ready.
            Prefer <strong>active</strong> only when counter/event key is in the cheat sheet above.
          </p>
        </div>

        <h2 class="section-title">Add badge</h2>
        <div class="panel" style="margin-bottom:18px">
          <form method="post" action="/admin/badges">
            <div class="form-grid">
              <div>
                <label for="code">Code</label>
                <input id="code" name="code" type="text" placeholder="lesson-starter-plus" required />
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for="name">Name</label>
                <input id="name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="Lesson Starter+" required />
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for="category">Category</label>
                <select id="category" name="category">
                  {{#each categories}}
                    <option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{label}}</option>
                  {{/each}}
                </select>
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for="rarity">Rarity</label>
                <select id="rarity" name="rarity">
                  {{#each rarities}}
                    <option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{label}}</option>
                  {{/each}}
                </select>
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for="status">Status</label>
                <select id="status" name="status">
                  {{#each statuses}}
                    <option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{label}}</option>
                  {{/each}}
                </select>
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for="criteriaType">Criteria type</label>
                <select id="criteriaType" name="criteriaType">
                  {{#each criteriaTypes}}
                    <option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{label}}</option>
                  {{/each}}
                </select>
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for="sortOrder">Sort order</label>
                <input id="sortOrder" name="sortOrder" type="number" value="100" />
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for="iconAssetKey">Icon asset key</label>
                <input id="iconAssetKey" name="iconAssetKey" type="text" placeholder="first-step (optional)" />
              </div>
              <div style="grid-column: 1 / -1">
                <label for="description">Description</label>
                <textarea id="description" name="description" placeholder="What the user did to earn this"></textarea>
              </div>
              <div style="grid-column: 1 / -1">
                <label for="criteriaJson">Criteria JSON</label>
                <textarea id="criteriaJson" name="criteriaJson" rows="4" required>{"counterKey":"lessons_completed","target":10}</textarea>
                <p class="muted" style="margin:6px 0 0;font-size:0.75rem">
                  Keys must match live counters/events (e.g. lessons_completed, weekly_streak, roadmap.generated.v1).
                  <code>composite</code> type never unlocks yet.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div style="grid-column: 1 / -1">
                <label for="rewardJson">Reward JSON</label>
                <textarea id="rewardJson" name="rewardJson" rows="2">{"coins":25}</textarea>
              </div>
              <div class="check-row">
                <input id="isHidden" name="isHidden" type="checkbox" value="1" />
                <label for="isHidden">Hidden from catalog</label>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="form-actions">
              {{> ui-button label="Create badge" icon="fa-solid fa-plus" }}
            </div>
          </form>
        </div>

        <h2 class="section-title">Catalog</h2>
        <div class="panel">
          {{#if hasRows}}
            <div class="table-wrap">
              <table class="data">
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th></th>
                    <th>Code</th>
                    <th>Name</th>
                    <th>Category</th>
                    <th>Rarity</th>
                    <th>Criteria</th>
                    <th>Status</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  {{#each rows}}
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        {{#if iconThumbUrl}}
                          <img src="{{iconThumbUrl}}" alt="" width="32" height="32" style="width:32px;height:32px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #d5ddd7" />
                        {{else}}
                          <span class="muted">—</span>
                        {{/if}}
                      </td>
                      <td class="mono"><a class="link" href="/admin/badges/{{id}}">{{code}}</a></td>
                      <td>{{name}}</td>
                      <td class="mono">{{category}}</td>
                      <td>{{rarity}}</td>
                      <td class="mono">{{criteriaType}}</td>
                      <td>
                        {{#if isActiveStatus}}
                          <span class="badge badge-ok">{{status}}</span>
                        {{else}}
                          <span class="badge badge-off">{{status}}</span>
                        {{/if}}
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                  {{/each}}
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          {{else}}
            <div class="empty">No badges yet. Create one above.</div>
          {{/if}}
        </div>
      </main>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
